Package: uofgdata
Type: Package
Title: Synthetic Market Data for the UofG R Monorepo
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Wyatt", "Au", , "wyatt_au@protonmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible synthetic OHLCV market data for research and
    testing. Generated series provably satisfy the monorepo's data
    contract (uofgstats::validate_ohlcv()) by construction, so examples
    and backtests never depend on external data sources.
